### Actual behavior

With `vite@8.1.4`, `dist/main.js` contains:

```js
if (!obj) {
	obj = new Plugin(this, $.fn.navgoco.defaults, idx);
	$this.data("navgoco", obj);
}
obj[options].apply(obj, args);
